<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="homepage-bg">

    <header class="site-header">
        <div class="logo-container">
            <img src="/pics/123.avif" alt="Logo" class="shop-logo">
        </div>

        <nav class="navbar">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/vehicletype">Vehicle Type</a> 
            <a href="/about">About</a>
            <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
      <main class="container">
        <section class="about-section">
            <h1>About and Instructions</h1>
              <div class="content-box">
                <h2>About</h2>
                  <p>Welcome to our <strong>Vehicle Knowledge Quiz Site</strong>! This website was developed to help vehicle enthusiasts test their knowledge. We deliver fresh and challenging questions about various categories of transportation.</p>
              </div>
        </section>

          <hr class="divider">

          <section class="instructions-section">
              <h2>Instruction!</h2>
              <h4>How to play and take the Quiz?</h4>
              <div class="instruction-cards">
                  <div class="card">
                      <span class="step-num">1. <strong>Setup</strong></span>
                      <p>Select the Category and choose Vehicles, and select your preffer Difficulty such us (Easy, Mediun, Hard), and the number of questions you want to answer up to 50, on the Home page.</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="card">
                      <span class="step-num">2. <strong>Focus</strong></span>
                      <p>You have <strong>15 seconds</strong> per question. Make sure your selection is fast and accurate!</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="card">
                      <span class="step-num">3. <strong>Results</strong></span>
                      <p>After the quiz, you will see your score and the correct answers for your review.</p>
                  </div>
              </div>
          </section>

          <p>
            Visit the <a href="/start">Start</a> page to learn how it integrates
            with OpenTDB.
          </p>
      </main>
    </div>

    <footer class="site-footer">
        <p>&copy; 2026 CJH-VEHICLE QUIZ</p>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>
